    "text": "<p>Match List I with List II</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>List &ndash; I<br />\t\t\t(Current configuration)</strong></td>\t\t\t<td colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>List &ndash; II<br />\t\t\t(Magnetic field at point</strong> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>O</mi></math><strong>)</strong></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>A</td>\t\t\t<td><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/6d4d8a8b-2cf2-4134-983a-f4d799603481-30c03559-a817-48e9-903a-8e729c6d34ea-9894246_A.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 128px;\" /></td>\t\t\t<td>I.</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>&#956;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>[</mo><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>]</mo></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>B</td>\t\t\t<td><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/fa41edbe-9bec-4bce-b977-38641dda9526-9894246_B.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 154px;\" /></td>\t\t\t<td>II.</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>&#956;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mfrac><mi>I</mi><mi>r</mi></mfrac></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>C</td>\t\t\t<td><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/0455c956-7478-44d1-aafb-f6da4de894cc-9894246_C.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 219px;\" /></td>\t\t\t<td>III.</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>&#956;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>[</mo><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>]</mo></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>D</td>\t\t\t<td><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/514b245c-d49c-45f0-bee9-5eeea479953f-9894246_D.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 89px;\" /></td>\t\t\t<td>IV.</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>&#956;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>[</mo><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>]</mo></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>Choose the correct answer from the option given below:</p>",
